:`c ≥ 3`, by 0.08–0.10**, and below every upper bound by a factor of 1.6–1.85 once Edwards–McDermid's\n585:Edwards–McDermid's degree-sequence bound is the closer upper bound at every `c`,\n756:- Edwards–McDermid (2015): closed form not read.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01S8F81w2AnQy1KgyQXSKRpU","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
